      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T23:10:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did this initially as `ApplyDynamicState()`, actually, and got tripped up by the `CmdBindPipeline()` in `ResolveTextureLoadingUtilsVk.cpp`. My goal was to hopefully normalize using a helper method like this across the board so that callers wouldn\u0027t easily forget to apply Dynamic State. However, if that\u0027s going to interfere with the YUV changes I\u0027m happy to go back to the `ApplyDynamicState()` pattern.",
      "parentUuid": "ae14053e_cb74f266",
      "revId": "b9709a0ef01574ab7a517d9c9d389de80d8fbfc4",
